# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# The last matching rule wins, so the broad rules come first.

# Paths that control how pull requests are reviewed and approved, including
# Bugbot's own rules and the auto-approve workflow. auto-approve-low-risk.yml
# never approves changes here, so a code owner reviews them.
/.github/ @cypress-io/product
/.cursor/ @cypress-io/product

# Plugins data — review requested automatically on PRs touching these files,
# including the nightly update-plugins-data automation. Its workflow is
# covered by the /.github/ rule above.
/src/data/plugins.json @cypress-io/product
/src/data/plugins-generated.json @cypress-io/product
